e,v=ev(70,'1–5','The king asks who first practiced and disclosed the vow and what merit/results it gives. Brahmā says Pārvatī practiced at Śiva’s instruction for four months when Skanda was gone and saw Kārttikeya in the fifth. Agastya desiring to drink the ocean practiced and drank it through Vighneśa’s favour in three months. Damayantī searching for Nala practiced for six months and then saw him. These are brief source reports; no unprovided journeys or battle details are added.',[(KF,F),('Brahmā',D),('Pārvatī',D),('Śiva',D),('Skanda',D),('Agastya',S),('Damayantī',F),('Nala',F),(RIT,'FAMILY')],story=S5,outcome='Three retrospective exempla give specific practice intervals and actual reported outcomes.')
power('Pārvatī',e,v,grant='Gaṇeśa',mechanism='After four months of the prescribed vow, sees Kārttikeya in the fifth month.',trigger='Vow practice at Śiva’s instruction.',duration='Four months of practice; sight in fifth.',notes='Brief retrospective outcome, not a narrated boon invitation/request exchange.')
power('Agastya',e,v,grant='Gaṇeśa',motive='Drink the ocean.',mechanism='Actually drinks the ocean through Vighneśa’s favour after three months of vow practice.',trigger='The vow practice.',duration='Three months.')
power('Damayantī',e,v,motive='Find Nala.',mechanism='Sees Nala after the reported vow.',trigger='Practice the vow while searching.',duration='Six months.',notes='This brief reported finding is distinct from prior Varada-vow former-birth account; no extra reconciliation or journey added.')
e,v=ev(70,'5–12','Citralekhā had taken Pradyumna’s son away. Grieving and uncertain where or by whom he was taken, Pradyumna hears Rukmiṇī address him as her son. She recalls Śambara abducting him when he was six days old, many years of grief and comparisons with other women’s growing sons, then Lomaśa’s fortunate visit and instruction in Sankaṣṭa-caturthī. She practiced four times; through its favour Pradyumna returned after killing Śambara in battle. She urges him to practice the same vow so he will learn where his son is.',[('Citralekhā',F),('Pradyumna',F),('Rukmiṇī',F),('Śambara',A),('Lomaśa',S),('Gaṇeśa',D)],story=S5,outcome='Rukmiṇī’s retrospective rescue experience becomes explicit mother-to-son instruction for a new search.')
rel('Rukmiṇī','mother_of','Pradyumna',e,'SOURCE_EXPLICIT_MOTHER_SON');rel('Śambara','abducts','Pradyumna',e);rel('Lomaśa','instructs','Rukmiṇī',e);rel('Rukmiṇī','instructs','Pradyumna',e)
